SUMMARY:🧭 Europe trip — 2-weeks-out final review
DESCRIPTION:Playbook checklist: re-verify every venue's hours/closed-days/closures for our dates; confirm all reservations & timed tickets are booked + saved offline; swap weather averages for the live forecast; install eSIM; download offline maps. (Travel insurance: DECLINED 6 Sep -- self-insuring, no need to revisit.) Since you're self-insured: call your health plan before you fly and ask exactly what it covers in Ireland/UK/France, and save the answer offline. Emergency number is 112 across all three (999 also works in UK and Ireland). Abroad you pay up front -- keep every receipt and itemised bill.\n\nNEW (Sept re-route): install MOBILE PASSPORT CONTROL (free CBP app) for both of you before departure - you now clear US customs at PHILADELPHIA on the way home (Nov 25), not Charlotte, and MPC skips most of the immigration queue. Also: the return lands Tampa 11:51 PM, the night before Thanksgiving - sort out parking or a pickup.\n\n--\nTHIS REMINDER REPEATS EVERY 2 DAYS until its deadline. Subscribed calendars are read-only, so iOS won't offer Snooze -- just dismiss it and it will come back. Once you've actually done this one, tell Claude and it gets removed from the feed for good.
